How to Solve the Problem after you've already made this mistake:
If you've already made this mistake, then you will need to create new abstractions.

function callThirdParty(x,y,z,foo=TRUE,bar=NULL){
  thirdPartyV2.x = sanitize(x);
  thirdPartyV2.y = sanitize(y);
  thirdPartyV2.z = sanitize(z);
  thirdPartyV2.foo = foo;
  thirdPartyV2.bar = bar;
  thirdPartyV2.run;
}

function callThirdPartyNewstuff(a,b,bar){
  thirdPartyV2.a = sanitize(a);
  thirdPartyV2.b = sanitize(b);
  thirdPartyV2.bar = bar;
  thirdPartyV2.run;
}

